stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: FootyLevels durable job lifecycle
    accDescr: Transactional leases fence running work. Transient errors and expired claims retry within bounded attempts and deadlines; cancellation and deletion prevent late publication.
    [*] --> queued: owner request or verified upload finalization
    queued --> running: claim transaction and new lease
    running --> running: heartbeat or expired-lease reclaim with fresh attempt
    running --> succeeded: complete verified output and fenced publish
    running --> partial: usable reconstruction with declared missing frames
    running --> retrying: transient failure within attempt and deadline bounds
    retrying --> running: eligible retry claims a fresh attempt
    queued --> failed: deadline or exhausted claim policy
    retrying --> failed: attempt or total deadline exhausted
    running --> failed: permanent input failure or exhausted policy
    queued --> cancelled: owned cancellation or project deletion
    running --> cancelled: owned cancellation or project deletion
    retrying --> cancelled: owned cancellation or project deletion
    succeeded --> [*]
    partial --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
